  "sections": [
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "每轮取一块电池",
        "en": "Pick up one battery each turn"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "for charge in batteries 从左到右取每块电池的读数，并把这轮的起始电量存进 charge。两块电池的读数一样时，它们也各占一轮。",
        "en": "for charge in batteries takes the readings from left to right. It puts each starting charge into charge for one turn. Two batteries with the same reading still have two turns."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "先算新电量，再追加一条结果",
        "en": "Calculate the new charge, then append one result"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "缩进里的两条指令每轮都运行。先把 charge 加 3，再用 append 把算好的电量放到结果列表的末尾。",
        "en": "The two indented instructions run on every turn. Add 3 to charge, then use append to put the result at the end of the list."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "用完列表，循环就结束",
        "en": "The loop ends when it runs out of items"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "最后一块处理完，for 找不到下一块，程序就去执行缩进外显示结果的那一行。",
        "en": "After the last battery is handled, for finds no next item. The program moves on to the line outside the loop that shows the results."
      }
    }
  ],
  "question": {
